 ('F14', 'Conclusion', "An advanced course on chapter 15 should add what the chapter leaves out: run the library against a stand-in so that every request can be inspected without an account; treat the token files as code; know that the Testing status makes the sign-in weekly and that the scopes are broad; read Google's quota page instead of the chapter's numbers and treat IGNORE_QUOTA as a throttle switch; batch writes (updateRows) instead of writing cells one at a time; guard the append against a second writer and the audit against an empty row; and pin the release, because the behaviour has changed between 2024.8.9 and 2025.11.11. What could not be run, any call with an OAuth token, is listed as NOT EXECUTED where it comes up [P01] [P07] [P28] [P39].", ['P01', 'P07', 'P28', 'P39']),
