 ["Sheets of a Spreadsheet: Sheet(), createSheet(), sheetTitles, as typed in the chapter's shell", PRE + 'ss = ezsheets.Spreadsheet(); ss.title = \'Multiple Sheets\'\nsh(\'ss.sheetTitles\'); sh("ss.Sheet(\'Spam\')"); sh("ss.createSheet(\'Eggs\')"); sh(\'ss.sheetTitles\')\nsh("ss.Sheet(\'Bacon\', 0)"); sh(\'ss.sheetTitles\'); sh(\'type(ss.sheets).__name__\'); sh(\'len(ss)\')\ntry:\n    ss.sheets[0] = None\nexcept TypeError as e:\n    print(e)\n', ">>> ss.sheetTitles\n('Sheet1',)\n>>> ss.Sheet('Spam')\nNone\n>>> ss.createSheet('Eggs')\n<Sheet sheetId=101, title='Eggs', rowCount=1000, columnCount=26>\n>>> ss.sheetTitles\n('Sheet1', 'Spam', 'Eggs')\n>>> ss.Sheet('Bacon', 0)\nNone\n>>> ss.sheetTitles\n('Bacon', 'Sheet1', 'Spam', 'Eggs')\n>>> type(ss.sheets).__name__\n'tuple'\n>>> len(ss)\n4\n'tuple' object does not support item assignment"],
